refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.returnvalues;

 Returns &true; if there is an element after the current one,
 &false; otherwise.

  &reftitle.examples;

   Detecting the last element


<?php
$fruits = new CachingIterator(new ArrayIterator(['apple', 'banana', 'cherry']));

foreach ($fruits as $fruit) {
    echo $fruit;

    if ($fruits->hasNext()) {
        echo ', ';
    }
}
?>


   &example.outputs;


apple, banana, cherry
